{# ------------------------------------------------ HOW IT WORKS #}
<section class="ec-how" id="how">
  <div class="wrap wrap--wide">
    <div class="ec-how-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
      <h2>Three steps. Your situation stays at the center.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="ec-steps">
      <li>
        <span class="ec-step-n">01</span>
        <h3>A first conversation</h3>
        <p>20 minutes to understand what you&rsquo;re facing and whether one-to-one coaching is the right tool for it.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ec-step-n">02</span>
        <h3>Agree the focus</h3>
        <p>One situation, one outcome you&rsquo;d recognize. We make it concrete before we start &mdash; so you can tell whether it&rsquo;s working.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ec-step-n">03</span>
        <h3>Work on the real thing</h3>
        <p>Regular one-to-one sessions, in person or virtual, on what&rsquo;s in front of you that week. Tools like <a href="/hbdi/">HBDI</a> and Immunity to Change come in where they help.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

